    "details": {
      "cr": {
        "base": 8
      },
      "alignment": "tn",
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>A disc-shaped robot the size of a shield, bristling with lenses, tools and a dart launcher. Drones build the sets, fix the cast, and sedate contestants who try to leave the stage. When the ratings hit 2, the next encounter gains one.</p>"
      },
      "notes": {
        "value": "<div class=\"hg-journal\"><h3>Printed stat block</h3><section class=\"hg-statblock\"><h4 class=\"hg-sb-title\">STAGEHAND DRONE — CR 8</h4><p><strong>XP</strong> 4,800 · N Small construct (robot)</p><p><strong>Init</strong> +8; <strong>Senses</strong> darkvision 60 ft., low-light vision; Perception +13</p><h5 class=\"hg-sb-section\">DEFENSE</h5><p><strong>AC</strong> 22, touch 16, flat-footed 17 (+4 Dex, +1 dodge, +6 natural, +1 size)</p><p><strong>hp</strong> 60 (9d10+10); force field (40 hp, fast healing 8)</p><p><strong>Fort</strong> +3, <strong>Ref</strong> +7, <strong>Will</strong> +4</p><p><strong>Immune</strong> construct traits; <strong>Weaknesses</strong> vulnerable to critical hits, vulnerable to electricity</p><h5 class=\"hg-sb-section\">OFFENSE</h5><p><strong>Speed</strong> 20 ft., fly 50 ft. (perfect)</p><p><strong>Ranged</strong> tranquilizer dart +14 (1d4 plus tranquilizer)</p><p><strong>Special Attacks</strong> repair beam, stage smoke</p><h5 class=\"hg-sb-section\">STATISTICS</h5><p><strong>Str</strong> 8, <strong>Dex</strong> 18, <strong>Con</strong> —, <strong>Int</strong> 10, <strong>Wis</strong> 12, <strong>Cha</strong> 8</p><p><strong>Base Atk</strong> +9; <strong>CMB</strong> +7; <strong>CMD</strong> 22</p><p><strong>Feats</strong> Dodge, Flyby Attack, Improved Initiative, Point-Blank Shot, Precise Shot</p><p><strong>Skills</strong> Disable Device +16, Fly +14, Perception +13</p><p><strong>Languages</strong> Androffan (understands only)</p><h5 class=\"hg-sb-section\">SPECIAL ABILITIES</h5><p><strong>Repair Beam (Ex)</strong> Five times per day as a standard action, the drone can restore 3d6+9 hit points to a construct within 30 feet. This does not restore force field hit points.</p><p><strong>Stage Smoke (Ex)</strong> Three times per day as a standard action, the drone can fill a 20-foot radius with smoke, as <em>obscuring mist</em>.</p><p><strong>Tranquilizer (Ex)</strong> Dart—injury; <em>save</em> Fort DC 16; <em>frequency</em> 1/round for 4 rounds; <em>effect</em> 1d2 Dex damage and staggered for 1 round; <em>cure</em> 1 save.</p></section></div>"
      }
    },
